    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Archery:</strong> one arrow at a time, nocked as part of the Attack action (no Reload Action). Load a stack of arrows and reload after each shot.</p><p><strong>Generic Tech weapon</strong> (excellent quality): the type is built in, at no extra cost, and takes no slots.</p><p><strong>Tech:</strong> <strong>Scope:</strong> sees simple target outlines through Thin cover. <strong>Charge:</strong> give up your Move Action. The charge lasts until the gun fires or 20 Rounds (60 seconds) pass. <strong>Charged shot:</strong> your next non-explosive attack is <strong>ROF1</strong>, fires through Thin cover, and ignores <strong>half the target's SP</strong> (round up) on a hit. Cover it fires through loses no HP: the holes are too small to damage it.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Weapons</small></p>"
